-- The 102 doctors Yeni Klinika publishes, as 101 new listings and one
-- addition to a doctor already here.
--
-- Read from yeniklinika.gov.az on 2026-09-19, in Azerbaijani. The seventh
-- source, and a state hospital rather than a private one.
--
-- The count is 102 and two readings agree. The directory page renders all 102
-- at once, which is easy to mistake for a slice because it also carries
-- data-lastpage="9" and a "Daha cox" button; requesting its nine ajax pages,
-- which need an X-Requested-With header or the server returns the whole page
-- again, gives 12 each and 6 on the last, and the union is exactly the same
-- 102 profiles. Neither list holds anything the other does not.
--
-- None of these doctors asked to be here. Every row is UNCLAIMED with
-- accepts_bookings = 0.
--
-- One of them is already in this directory. Turan Mammadaliyev is listed from
-- referansclc.com at Referans Merdekan Hospital: same specialty, same
-- university, same years - Qazi Universiteti 2011-2017 on both. He is one
-- doctor who works in two hospitals, so he gets a second clinic rather than a
-- second listing, which is the whole reason doctor_clinic is a join table.
--
-- Three other names already existed and are not the same people. Lale Aliyeva
-- here is an anaesthetist who qualified in 1996; the Lale Aliyeva at Merkezi
-- Klinika is a neurologist. Tural Mammadov here is an invasive cardiologist;
-- the one at Referans is a gastroenterologist. Their slugs are suffixed so
-- INSERT IGNORE cannot quietly drop them.
--
-- Two names repeat inside this hospital and are also two people each. Both
-- Nigar Bayramovas qualified in 2008-2014, but one is a paediatrician and the
-- other a radiologist, with different photographs. The two Sabina Tagiyevas
-- trained a decade apart, one at ATU and one at Hacettepe. Where a name
-- repeats, the photograph and the specialty both have to agree before the
-- pages are treated as one person.
--
-- The centres on this site - Cerrahiyye ve Transplantasiya, Somatika ve
-- STROK, Urek-Damar and the rest - are departments inside one building, not
-- separate addresses, so there is one clinic row.
--
-- Every doctor states their education, and 101 of them have a portrait at
-- 800x1200, the largest any source has offered. Their host answers an A record
-- but will not resolve through the system resolver, so the fetch has to pin
-- the address.
--
-- Data only.

-- Speech and language therapy: a logoped is who a parent is sent to when a
-- child is not speaking, and nothing in the taxonomy covered it.
INSERT IGNORE INTO specialty (code, name_az, name_en, name_ru, patient_facing, ai_specialty_code, sort_order) VALUES
('speech-therapy','Loqopediya','Speech and Language Therapy','Логопедия',1,'general',118);

INSERT INTO clinic (name, slug, address, city, phone, description, active, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT * FROM (SELECT
    'Yeni Klinika' AS name, 'yeni-klinika' AS slug,
    'Heydər Əliyev prospekti 142, Bakı' AS address, 'Bakı' AS city,
    '+994 12 505 62 31' AS phone,
    'Yeni Klinika, Bakı. Siyahı klinikanın yeniklinika.gov.az saytındakı həkim kataloqu əsasında hazırlanıb.' AS description,
    1 AS active, NOW() AS created_at, NOW() AS updated_at) AS c
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM clinic WHERE slug = 'yeni-klinika');

